<title>USA: GREENWICH SAYS JUSTICE DEPT OKS UNC BUY.</title>
<headline>GREENWICH SAYS JUSTICE DEPT OKS UNC BUY.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greenwich Air Services Inc said Monday the Federal Trade Commission has notified it that the Department of Justice approved the acquisition of UNC Inc.</p>
<p>The company said, however, the department has not made any final determination on its acquisition by the General Electric, which is still under review by the department.</p>
</text>
